      <span class="hero__kicker">Sanjaya Lall &middot; 1940&ndash;2005</span>
      <h1 style="max-width:16ch;">The economist behind the chair</h1>
      <p class="hero__lede">
        Sanjaya Lall spent four decades at Oxford asking why some countries learn to make
        things the world wants &mdash; and insisting, against the current of his profession,
        that the answer lay in capabilities deliberately built, not advantages passively
        received.
      </p>
